Generate recovery bootchian on the compiled debian system by using the following command package:
Usage: ./pack_recovery.sh [die0_bootchain] [die1_bootchain]
  parm1：(required),/path/die0_bootchain.bin
  parm2：(optional),/path/die1_bootchain.bin
eg:
  ./pack_recovery.sh /path/die0_bootchain.bin
  ./pack_recovery.sh /path/die0_bootchain.bin /path/die1_bootchain.bin

After the execution is complete, the corresponding recovery bootchian is generated in the current directory
